Z||000005||Urchin||09-16-2001||10:09 PM||||Hearing/reading the above really puts things into perspective.  I have been argueing back and forth with myself over the appropriate actions to take (obviously not my decision).  Let's face it, this can't be ignored.  Some form of action must be taken.  The Taliban is apparently not willing to give up Bin Laden.  And considering what was said above, what do we do?  Hoping that Bush makes the right decision, and that things do not turn any uglier than they have to is all we can do I guess.  Regardless of what steps are taken, innocent people are going to die.  But, if no actions were taken, and Bin Laden faces no form of punishment, then more will die in the future.  I would not want to be in Bush's shoes right now.  I'm sure he is fully aware of the pros and cons of all options.  I'm assuming that is one of the reasons for the delay (aside from establishing proof).    I guess all we can do is hope for the best.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/final.jpg"> <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
Z||000006||California Kid||09-16-2001||10:19 PM||||The first post is a very accurate summation, however I agree 100% with maryjane.<P>I don't know what the exact capabilities are currently for people in this region to launch nuclear weapons, I'm guessing they don't have too many and range is limited (Arabs included).  I do know that when they have enough technology to strike us with these weapons, they will one day in the not so distant future.  I think the world also realizes that it's time to "wean the herd out a little bit". Mankind does not need these kind of people on the planet.<P>Prediction of the future, about this timeframe was that World War To End All Wars would be started by someone from this region wearing a blue turban. <P>From what's happened lately, we could be headed that direction, unless NATO forms a huge sniper army to unleash on the globe. The fact of the matter is that no one is safe now, we're all targets.<P>If the free world doesn't get a handle on this, we'll all be packing guns in the future.<P>Just my opinion, I could be wrong.<P>(should have run spell check the first time)<BR>[This message has been edited by California Kid (edited 09-16-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by California Kid (edited 09-16-2001).]||||reg||1
